  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>You’ve asked, and we’ve listened. Massive thanks to each one of you who wants to help spread our work to disseminate the latest in nutrition research. With more than ten years’ worth of informational content, several books and cookbooks, and our newer resources, including guides and infographics, we have plenty of ways for you to share in whatever way works best. Here are some suggestions: </p>\n<h2><b>1. Share a Video</b></h2>\n<p>Watch our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/dining-by-traffic-light-green-is-for-go-red-is-for-stop/\">Traffic Light Dining System</a> video in which Dr. Greger explains his traffic light system for ranking the relative healthfulness of Green Light vs. Yellow Light vs. Red Light foods, and share it with others. </p>\n<p></p><div class=\"entry-content-asset\"><iframe width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yrjbxWtNl4M?feature=oembed&amp;rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" title=\"Dining by Traffic Light: Green Is for Go, Red Is for Stop\"></iframe></div>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2><b>2. Download the</b> <b><i>Evidence-Based Eating Guide </i></b><b>and the </b><b><i>Daily Dozen Meal Planning Guide</i></b></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">Check out our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/owbuoxuqxg7ew7lz17ntbfdg7bdh9rkq\"><i>Evidence-Based Eating Guide</i></a>, and share it with others to help them simplify making the switch to a healthier lifestyle. You can download it for free in <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/s6nmnbkj9c2fdio0qua2bze5ko5ogqch\">English</a>, <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/bp0ahfnzq6j2cx7n4t5i2u2vzbcx7iqz\">Spanish</a>, and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/v/cn-eating-guide\">Chinese</a>, and request a print version <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch?sort_by=\">here</a>. And don’t forget about our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/v56vadg4t8xvxcefxwfm3e5sxtck7t6g\"><i>Daily Dozen Meal Planning Guide</i></a>. This resource will help you incorporate the Daily Dozen checklist into your meal planning.</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91834 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-960x1200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-960x1200.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-1024x1280.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-768x960.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-1200x1500.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-720x900.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all-540x675.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/evidence-based-eating-guide-all.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 240px) 100vw, 240px\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<h2><b>3. Share Our Infographics </b></h2>\n<p>Read through our infographics on <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/j3w6zg5kjcf6vkgoy69i7i48zhe5i62u\">vitamin B12</a>, <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/sj5ux3jff0r726x5x0e48sf8h0dx0ih6\">vitamin D</a>, <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/mju0o48ofqm1snag2ibiqiszri4v8wl2\">plant-based meat</a>, and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/rbkej9evdfisnyiqil47y85zaej8e892\">sweet potatoes</a>, and share any (or all) of them.</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/j3w6zg5kjcf6vkgoy69i7i48zhe5i62u\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91840 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b-960x1707.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"169\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b-960x1707.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b-1024x1820.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b-720x1280.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b-540x960.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/story-b.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/sj5ux3jff0r726x5x0e48sf8h0dx0ih6\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91836 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a-960x1707.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"169\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a-960x1707.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a-1024x1820.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a-720x1280.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a-540x960.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/ig-story-a.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/mju0o48ofqm1snag2ibiqiszri4v8wl2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91838 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1-960x1707.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"169\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1-960x1707.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1-1024x1820.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1-720x1280.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1-540x960.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/pb-meat-story-v1.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/rbkej9evdfisnyiqil47y85zaej8e892\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91842 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2-960x1707.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"169\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2-960x1707.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2-1024x1820.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2-720x1280.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2-540x960.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/the-benefits-of-sweet-potatoes-story-2.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 169px) 100vw, 169px\"/></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<h2><b>4. Share Dr. Greger’s Daily Dozen App</b></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.6412%; height: 10px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 448px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dr-gregers-daily-dozen/id1060700802\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-91884 size-medium\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/app-2-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 10px;\">What are some of the healthiest foods that we should eat every day? Check out Dr. Greger’s free <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dr-gregers-daily-dozen/id1060700802\">Daily Dozen app</a>, and share it with friends and family. You can even encourage others to start a <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen-challenge/\">challenge</a> to see how many streaks they can achieve. </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><b>5. Start Cooking</b></h2>\n<p>Cook a dish from <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-die-cookbook/\"><i>The How Not to Die Cookbook</i></a> or <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet-cookbook/\"><i>The How Not to Diet Cookbook</i></a>, and share with friends and family. For more Green-Light recipes, check out our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipes/\">recipe page</a>. </p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91854 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-960x640.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-768x512.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-720x480.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/apps-17-540x360.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91856 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-960x640.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-768x512.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-720x480.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-1314-540x360.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91858 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-960x640.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-768x512.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-720x480.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/img-9365-540x360.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2><b>6. Share NutritionFacts Resources with Your Health Professionals</b></h2>\n<p>The next time you see your doctor or dietitian, introduce them to Dr. Greger’s work. Show them the <i>Evidence-Based Eating Guide</i> on your phone, or give them a <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/products/nutritionfacts-business-cards\">business card</a>. </p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/outreach/products/healthkit\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91860 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-960x1200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-960x1200.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-1024x1280.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-768x960.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-1200x1500.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-720x900.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562-540x675.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/20190404-nf-0562.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 240px) 100vw, 240px\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/products/nutritionfacts-business-cards\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91862 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/cards-2-update-960x1200.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/cards-2-update-960x1200.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/cards-2-update-768x960.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/cards-2-update-720x900.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/cards-2-update-540x675.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/cards-2-update.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 240px) 100vw, 240px\"/></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><b> </b></p>\n<h2><b>7. Donate Copies of Dr. Greger’s Books</b></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">Leave copies of <i>How Not to Die</i>, <i>How Not to Diet</i>, or any of his cookbooks in places with public bookshelves, such as Little Free Libraries or a shelf in your favorite cafe.</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91938 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/2021-books-cover-isolated-960x674.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"211\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/2021-books-cover-isolated-960x674.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/2021-books-cover-isolated-1024x719.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/2021-books-cover-isolated-768x539.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/2021-books-cover-isolated-720x506.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/2021-books-cover-isolated-540x379.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/2021-books-cover-isolated.png 1112w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<h2><b>8. Host a Book Club or Screening</b></h2>\n<p>Are you a part of a book club or interested in starting one? Suggest <i>How Not to Die</i> as the next title to read! Learn more about the book <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-die/\">here</a>. Why not consider <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/screenings/\">hosting a screening</a> of Dr. Greger’s “<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\">How Not to Die</a>” or “<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\">Evidence-Based Weight Loss</a>” presentation? Happy viewing!</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91869 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mango-smoothie-hntd-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91878 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/mg-july-2019-16-2-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<h2><b>9. Volunteer with NutritionFacts.org</b></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 102.952%; height: 201px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 201px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 201px;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-91866 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/volunteergraphic-2021-wide-v2-960x503.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/volunteergraphic-2021-wide-v2-960x503.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/volunteergraphic-2021-wide-v2-1024x536.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/volunteergraphic-2021-wide-v2-768x402.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/volunteergraphic-2021-wide-v2-720x377.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/volunteergraphic-2021-wide-v2-540x283.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/volunteergraphic-2021-wide-v2.png 1201w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 201px;\">We can’t do our work without the help of volunteers. Please consider signing up for our volunteer newsletter <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/nutritionmission/\">here</a> to stay up-to-date with tasks and projects you can do to support NutritionFacts.org. For instance, do you have a strong background in professional translation? Our videos and blog posts are translated by volunteers. Apply <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/translators/\">here to</a> help make this life-saving information more accessible to people all over the world. </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2><b>10. Stay Connected!</b></h2>\n<p>Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\">Instagram</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@nutrition_facts_org\">TikTok</a>, and share our posts. You can also add a link to NutritionFacts.org in your email signature so every recipient of a message you write is introduced to our work. For instance, add this line to your email signature: Check out <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org\">NutritionFacts.org</a> for the latest in nutrition research.</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">If you believe in our mission to share the latest evidence-based health and nutrition information for free to the public, please consider making a donation <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/\">here</a>. </td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-91881 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/donate.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"186\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/donate.jpg 850w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/donate-768x767.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/donate-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/donate-720x719.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/04/donate-540x539.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 186px) 100vw, 186px\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>We hope these are helpful ways you can encourage healthy habits and share potentially life-changing information with others you know. As usual, everything on our website and platforms is free, and all of the proceeds from Dr. Greger’s book sales are donated to charity. Thank you for your support!</p>"
